1
00:00:07,745 --> 00:00:09,065
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:37,145 --> 00:01:43,025
‎ADAPTED FROM XI XING’S NOVEL
<i>‎QUEEN CHU</i>‎ ON QIDIAN.COM

3
00:01:47,545 --> 00:01:49,825
I'll kill you, you traitor!

4
00:01:49,905 --> 00:01:51,025
You deserve to die!

5
00:01:51,105 --> 00:01:52,825
Traitor!

6
00:01:52,905 --> 00:01:55,465
-Traitor!
-Go die!

7
00:01:55,545 --> 00:01:57,265
You deserve to die!

8
00:01:57,345 --> 00:01:58,865
-Shameless!
-You don't deserve to live on.

9
00:01:58,945 --> 00:02:01,265
-I'll make you pay!
-Die!

10
00:02:02,425 --> 00:02:03,705
You should pay!

11
00:02:03,785 --> 00:02:04,945
Die!

12
00:02:07,465 --> 00:02:08,304
Drop dead!

13
00:02:09,985 --> 00:02:12,505
-You took General Chu's life!
-Die!

14
00:02:12,585 --> 00:02:14,145
-General Chu was such an honorable man.
-Traitor!

15
00:02:14,225 --> 00:02:15,785
-You don't deserve to live.
-Go die!

16
00:02:15,865 --> 00:02:17,945
-Go to hell!
-Beat you to death!

17
00:02:18,025 --> 00:02:21,225
-I'll kill you!
-You treacherous parasite!

18
00:03:13,305 --> 00:03:15,225
<i>You ferocious little thing.</i>

19
00:03:15,305 --> 00:03:16,185
<i>You've got a vicious bite.</i>

20
00:03:17,025 --> 00:03:18,265
<i>I hurt your men.</i>

21
00:03:18,985 --> 00:03:19,825
<i>Just go ahead and kill me.</i>

22
00:03:21,505 --> 00:03:22,985
<i>You wish to die?</i>

23
00:03:35,385 --> 00:03:36,785
Do you know why?

24
00:03:37,465 --> 00:03:40,705
Because deep down,
you still cling to life.

25
00:03:52,865 --> 00:03:55,625
Since you're not going to die today,
you're coming with me.

26
00:04:00,465 --> 00:04:01,545
Kill him!

27
00:04:07,145 --> 00:04:09,345
Give way! Stand clear!

28
00:04:09,425 --> 00:04:10,465
Move aside!

29
00:04:10,545 --> 00:04:12,065
-Clear out, all of you!
-Make way!

30
00:04:13,065 --> 00:04:16,265
Whatever Xie Yanlai's crimes may be,
he will face a military tribunal.

31
00:04:16,345 --> 00:04:18,145
None of you may take justice
into your own hands!

32
00:04:22,905 --> 00:04:24,105
On your feet.

33
00:04:26,545 --> 00:04:28,065
At that time,

34
00:04:28,145 --> 00:04:30,985
we knew that medicine
was meant to save the General.

35
00:04:31,065 --> 00:04:33,745
Nobody could have foreseen
that it would end up like this.

36
00:04:33,825 --> 00:04:35,425
The court even honored your service

37
00:04:35,505 --> 00:04:37,465
and rewarded you
for the Northern Desert campaign.

38
00:04:37,545 --> 00:04:38,545
Why are you groveling?

39
00:04:38,625 --> 00:04:40,465
Who are you trying to atone to?

40
00:04:41,265 --> 00:04:42,425
Honored?

41
00:04:46,945 --> 00:04:48,385
That honor was bought
with the General's life.

42
00:04:48,465 --> 00:04:50,985
We had no better choice back then.

43
00:04:54,265 --> 00:04:56,145
You…

44
00:05:00,105 --> 00:05:01,305
Goodness.

45
00:05:05,265 --> 00:05:06,665
A mistake is a mistake.

46
00:05:07,625 --> 00:05:08,865
There is no excuse for it.

47
00:05:48,425 --> 00:05:51,585
Since when does Yunzhong Prefecture
allow vigilante justice?

48
00:06:04,305 --> 00:06:05,385
CAPITAL

49
00:06:26,025 --> 00:06:26,945
Your Highness, please discern the truth!

50
00:06:27,025 --> 00:06:31,225
General Chu died a senseless death,
and we cannot stomach this injustice!

51
00:06:31,305 --> 00:06:33,185
He's a monster in human skin!

52
00:06:33,265 --> 00:06:36,545
If he is innocent of General Chu's murder,
why submit to punishment so readily?

53
00:06:36,625 --> 00:06:38,945
Did any of you actually witness
him commit the murder?

54
00:06:43,625 --> 00:06:45,425
THE GREAT BORDER GATE

55
00:06:46,745 --> 00:06:47,705
Xie Yanlai.

56
00:06:48,985 --> 00:06:52,745
Before the people of Yunzhong Prefecture,
I will ask you one last time.

57
00:06:54,705 --> 00:06:56,145
Did you truly intend

58
00:06:57,665 --> 00:06:59,065
to harm my father?

59
00:07:06,865 --> 00:07:09,025
Your Highness,
you mustn't believe a word he says.

60
00:07:09,105 --> 00:07:10,585
He's of the Xie Family!

61
00:07:13,745 --> 00:07:15,825
He entered my father's service at 16.

62
00:07:16,585 --> 00:07:18,625
Xie Yanlai is first a soldier
of the Chu Army,

63
00:07:18,705 --> 00:07:19,825
only then, a member of the Xie Family.

64
00:07:22,305 --> 00:07:25,585
If you wonder how my father died,

65
00:07:27,785 --> 00:07:29,345
I shall lay bare the truth now.

66
00:07:30,305 --> 00:07:31,265
Army Physician!

67
00:07:32,105 --> 00:07:35,625
The poison that struck the General
is known as the Bloodburn Pill,

68
00:07:35,705 --> 00:07:38,225
refined from several lethal toxins.

69
00:07:39,105 --> 00:07:43,265
In a short span,
it forces the blood to race

70
00:07:43,345 --> 00:07:45,585
and causes a violent surge
of physical strength.

71
00:07:45,665 --> 00:07:49,345
It can even grant a dying man
a final, fleeting burst of vitality.

72
00:07:50,065 --> 00:07:52,545
Three years ago,
at the Battle of the Frontier River,

73
00:07:52,625 --> 00:07:54,585
General Chu was struck
by a poisoned arrow.

74
00:07:55,105 --> 00:07:57,025
The Army Physician was entirely helpless.

75
00:07:57,105 --> 00:07:59,825
I watched as the General
coughed up blood relentlessly.

76
00:07:59,905 --> 00:08:01,785
It was Jiu's pill

77
00:08:01,865 --> 00:08:04,985
that dragged the General back
from the very brink of death.

78
00:08:05,065 --> 00:08:05,905
No way!

79
00:08:05,985 --> 00:08:08,385
We believed that medicine
was his last hope.

80
00:08:08,465 --> 00:08:10,185
But who could have guessed

81
00:08:10,705 --> 00:08:12,025
it would only defer the General's demise
at a terrible cost?

82
00:08:13,025 --> 00:08:15,025
Yet, if we hadn't used it that day,

83
00:08:15,625 --> 00:08:20,145
the General
would have perished on the spot.

84
00:08:23,025 --> 00:08:24,585
Did we truly misjudge him?

85
00:08:24,665 --> 00:08:26,625
-He didn't do it?
-Really?

86
00:08:26,705 --> 00:08:27,865
In the 14th year of Tianshu,

87
00:08:28,905 --> 00:08:30,465
Jiu first joined Yunzhong Prefecture.

88
00:08:31,865 --> 00:08:32,985
While on patrol,

89
00:08:33,825 --> 00:08:35,625
he discovered a Northern Desert scout
infiltrating our frontier.

90
00:08:36,784 --> 00:08:40,545
Though only a boy of 16,
he fought them off at all costs,

91
00:08:41,144 --> 00:08:44,264
sustaining multiple stab wounds,
one just half a cun from his heart.

92
00:08:45,065 --> 00:08:46,185
In the 15th year of Tianshu,

93
00:08:47,345 --> 00:08:50,665
when the Northern Desert troops
raided a frontier village,

94
00:08:53,145 --> 00:08:54,665
General Chu led the counterattack.

95
00:08:55,385 --> 00:08:59,185
Jiu took a spear strike
meant for the General on his shoulders,

96
00:08:59,945 --> 00:09:01,905
shielding the entire village.

97
00:09:02,745 --> 00:09:04,945
In the 16th year of Tianshu,
when the enemy struck again,

98
00:09:05,545 --> 00:09:07,425
he defended the frontier river
with the General.

99
00:09:07,945 --> 00:09:10,225
He took two hits amidst a hail of arrows,

100
00:09:10,865 --> 00:09:12,145
but managed to chop down the drawbridge,

101
00:09:12,225 --> 00:09:16,345
halting the enemy's advance
and sparing the State of Chu

102
00:09:16,425 --> 00:09:17,905
from total devastation.

103
00:09:18,625 --> 00:09:20,185
And during the recent battle of Wangcheng,

104
00:09:20,905 --> 00:09:22,185
he infiltrated the enemy camp alone

105
00:09:22,825 --> 00:09:24,385
to sabotage their provisions
and water supplies,

106
00:09:24,465 --> 00:09:26,665
nearly losing his life in the fray.

107
00:09:28,145 --> 00:09:32,225
Would a man like this
truly harm his own commander?

108
00:09:32,305 --> 00:09:33,145
-Indeed.
-Right…

109
00:09:33,225 --> 00:09:37,545
Every scar on Jiu's body was earned
while shielding you all.

110
00:09:37,625 --> 00:09:40,465
If you want to take his life,
look at those wounds

111
00:09:40,545 --> 00:09:42,825
and ask yourselves
if your consciences can bear it.

112
00:09:45,345 --> 00:09:47,865
Are we to kill a man
who saved General Chu,

113
00:09:48,465 --> 00:09:51,785
Yunzhong Prefecture, and the State of Chu,

114
00:09:52,305 --> 00:09:54,025
just on a rumor?

115
00:09:54,825 --> 00:09:55,705
Back then,

116
00:09:56,505 --> 00:10:00,305
Fu Jiu snuck into
a Northern Desert camp to save us

117
00:10:00,945 --> 00:10:04,025
and took the branding for us
when he was discovered.

118
00:10:04,745 --> 00:10:05,865
Back at the frontier river,

119
00:10:06,385 --> 00:10:08,825
I was about to be crushed
under the enemy cavalry.

120
00:10:09,345 --> 00:10:10,545
It was Fu Jiu who dragged me back.

121
00:10:10,625 --> 00:10:13,625
I saw him risk his life for the General.

122
00:10:13,705 --> 00:10:16,345
I refuse to believe
a man like that could turn traitor.

123
00:10:17,025 --> 00:10:20,145
Look at all his scars.

124
00:10:20,665 --> 00:10:22,385
Fighting the Northern Desert troops

125
00:10:23,105 --> 00:10:25,385
must have been a constant dance
with death.

126
00:10:26,065 --> 00:10:28,865
Looking at what he's endured,
I shall never believe…

127
00:11:23,265 --> 00:11:24,105
Thank you.

128
00:11:24,985 --> 00:11:28,305
I was just telling…
the people what really happened.

129
00:11:29,985 --> 00:11:31,225
This incident did not happen by chance.

130
00:11:32,345 --> 00:11:33,865
Someone must be pulling the strings.

131
00:11:35,585 --> 00:11:36,425
It is all my fault.

132
00:11:39,745 --> 00:11:41,625
If he hadn't taken the medicine
I provided…

133
00:11:43,105 --> 00:11:45,905
Zhao. I know you hate me.

134
00:11:47,225 --> 00:11:48,545
You have every right to.

135
00:11:49,985 --> 00:11:50,945
I did hate you once.

136
00:11:52,785 --> 00:11:53,785
But I realize

137
00:11:55,265 --> 00:11:57,705
that you were merely a convenient outlet
for my grief and fury.

138
00:11:59,465 --> 00:12:01,065
I felt so utterly powerless,

139
00:12:02,065 --> 00:12:06,145
with no one to hold accountable
or to blame.

140
00:12:07,065 --> 00:12:11,705
After all, this was my father's choice.

141
00:12:12,665 --> 00:12:15,785
He chose to die
on the battlefield as a commander,

142
00:12:16,865 --> 00:12:17,945
claiming one final victory

143
00:12:18,025 --> 00:12:20,145
over his lifelong nemesis,
the Northern Desert King.

144
00:12:21,505 --> 00:12:25,265
And I was there,
fighting right alongside him.

145
00:12:26,625 --> 00:12:28,305
He lived his final moments

146
00:12:29,145 --> 00:12:32,825
to the fullest, with no regrets.

147
00:12:37,865 --> 00:12:39,905
I have no right to blame you.

148
00:12:41,665 --> 00:12:42,585
If anything…

149
00:12:45,825 --> 00:12:47,305
I ought to thank you.

150
00:12:57,265 --> 00:12:59,065
The General dictated this,

151
00:12:59,905 --> 00:13:02,585
ordered me to record it,
and bring it to you.

152
00:13:18,185 --> 00:13:21,465
<i>Zhao, to read these words</i>
<i>is to meet again.</i>

153
00:13:22,625 --> 00:13:24,745
<i>Last night, I saw you in my dreams.</i>

154
00:13:25,265 --> 00:13:28,465
<i>You were still that young girl,</i>
<i>spurring your horse away from home.</i>

155
00:13:29,465 --> 00:13:31,465
I reached out to hold you back,

156
00:13:31,985 --> 00:13:35,505
but my hand caught nothing
but drifting sand.

157
00:13:36,545 --> 00:13:40,705
Only now do I realize
that 19 years on the battlefield

158
00:13:41,505 --> 00:13:42,905
have long stripped me

159
00:13:44,345 --> 00:13:46,225
of the right to be your father.

160
00:13:47,745 --> 00:13:49,305
<i>That year, you asked me in tears</i>

161
00:13:50,785 --> 00:13:54,705
<i>why I kept you confined</i>
<i>to the desolate desert.</i>

162
00:13:55,585 --> 00:13:59,225
<i>I mistook it for youthful rebellion.</i>

163
00:13:59,305 --> 00:14:01,585
<i>I never understood</i>
<i>that what you yearned for</i>

164
00:14:02,545 --> 00:14:04,745
<i>was never the Capital's splendor,</i>

165
00:14:05,785 --> 00:14:09,705
but merely a light
left burning beneath the eaves

166
00:14:11,025 --> 00:14:12,425
to welcome you home.

167
00:14:13,785 --> 00:14:18,225
<i>I've heard that the noble ladies</i>
<i>of the Capital are prideful and harsh.</i>

168
00:14:19,265 --> 00:14:24,785
<i>I cannot bear to think how much scorn</i>
<i>you've endured among them.</i>

169
00:14:25,665 --> 00:14:27,385
<i>Every time the thought crosses my mind,</i>

170
00:14:28,585 --> 00:14:30,225
<i>it tears at my very soul.</i>

171
00:14:31,665 --> 00:14:33,425
For 19 years,

172
00:14:34,585 --> 00:14:37,185
I was not there to guide your early steps,

173
00:14:38,305 --> 00:14:41,625
<i>nor to instruct you in the classics.</i>

174
00:14:43,065 --> 00:14:46,505
<i>I am consumed by remorse.</i>

175
00:14:47,265 --> 00:14:49,025
<i>If life could start again,</i>

176
00:14:49,665 --> 00:14:53,545
<i>you would not be called</i>
<i>the daughter of a hero,</i>

177
00:14:54,425 --> 00:14:56,545
<i>but of Chu Ling, of mine.</i>

178
00:14:57,505 --> 00:14:58,385
<i>Might that be enough?</i>

179
00:15:06,385 --> 00:15:08,705
General. I'll fetch the Army Physician.

180
00:15:08,785 --> 00:15:10,025
Finish it.

181
00:15:13,105 --> 00:15:16,945
I have spent half my life in the saddle.

182
00:15:18,865 --> 00:15:20,345
I've failed none

183
00:15:22,225 --> 00:15:23,865
but my wife and daughter.

184
00:15:25,145 --> 00:15:29,745
Now, I ask for nothing
but your forgiveness.

185
00:15:30,745 --> 00:15:33,945
<i>Though tomorrow I may fall</i>
<i>on the battlefield,</i>

186
00:15:34,625 --> 00:15:36,545
<i>I shall embrace death with a smile.</i>

187
00:15:37,905 --> 00:15:39,025
<i>Zhao,</i>

188
00:15:40,465 --> 00:15:42,505
<i>water flows forward, never to return.</i>

189
00:15:43,145 --> 00:15:44,985
Do not look back.

190
00:15:47,225 --> 00:15:48,865
Keep moving forward.

191
00:15:50,545 --> 00:15:54,945
<i>From your father, Chu Ling,</i>
<i>in his final hour.</i>

192
00:16:00,105 --> 00:16:00,945
Stop.

193
00:16:10,905 --> 00:16:11,945
Jiu.

194
00:16:14,825 --> 00:16:18,825
Why didn't he tell me these things sooner?

195
00:16:20,905 --> 00:16:25,785
If he had just spoken up earlier,
I might have had time to make amends.

196
00:16:26,945 --> 00:16:28,425
And my mother.

197
00:16:29,345 --> 00:16:35,065
She will never hear
what I longed to tell her.

198
00:16:37,625 --> 00:16:38,585
I know.

199
00:16:40,625 --> 00:16:41,825
I truly understand.

200
00:16:41,905 --> 00:16:43,465
The last words

201
00:16:44,625 --> 00:16:50,145
of my father were that war is too cruel.

202
00:16:52,305 --> 00:16:54,385
He asked when it would finally end.

203
00:16:56,345 --> 00:16:59,185
My father gave his life for this victory.

204
00:17:00,745 --> 00:17:03,065
But if the flames of war
are never quenched,

205
00:17:04,385 --> 00:17:06,184
what meaning did their sacrifice have?

206
00:17:17,224 --> 00:17:18,424
I will ensure

207
00:17:20,424 --> 00:17:21,905
the State of Chu

208
00:17:22,745 --> 00:17:24,944
never again paves the road
to peace with blood.

209
00:17:27,745 --> 00:17:30,025
I will make sure the children of this land

210
00:17:31,665 --> 00:17:35,785
never lose their parents
to the scourge of war.

211
00:18:07,705 --> 00:18:09,905
Playing the saint again, are you?

212
00:18:09,985 --> 00:18:13,705
You claim you can shield an entire city,
but can you even protect yourself?

213
00:18:13,785 --> 00:18:15,985
What good is a second chance at life?

214
00:18:16,905 --> 00:18:19,425
You still had to watch your father die

215
00:18:20,025 --> 00:18:21,945
and your mother meet her bitter end.

216
00:18:23,105 --> 00:18:24,505
But neither of them

217
00:18:26,585 --> 00:18:28,665
regretted the choices they made.

218
00:18:28,745 --> 00:18:29,985
Self-delusion, nothing more.

219
00:18:30,625 --> 00:18:33,665
Lest you forget,
your enemies remain untouched.

220
00:18:34,945 --> 00:18:36,465
Not just Xiao Xun,

221
00:18:37,185 --> 00:18:39,505
but the Northern Desert
that destroyed your parents.

222
00:18:40,385 --> 00:18:41,705
If I were you,

223
00:18:41,785 --> 00:18:43,625
I would march the army
against the Northern Desert now

224
00:18:43,705 --> 00:18:45,385
and drown them in a reckoning of blood.

225
00:18:46,425 --> 00:18:47,345
No.

226
00:18:49,825 --> 00:18:51,905
The frontier troops
have bled far too much.

227
00:18:51,985 --> 00:18:52,945
And what of it?

228
00:18:53,025 --> 00:18:54,745
Glory is built upon bones.

229
00:18:54,825 --> 00:18:56,705
War demands sacrifice.

230
00:18:56,785 --> 00:18:58,785
Their blood means nothing to you.

231
00:18:59,705 --> 00:19:01,305
The army is yours to wield.

232
00:19:01,985 --> 00:19:02,985
Say the word,

233
00:19:03,065 --> 00:19:06,585
and they shall obey
and bleed for your cause.

234
00:19:07,465 --> 00:19:11,505
Don't you want to avenge your parents
upon the Northern Desert King?

235
00:19:13,585 --> 00:19:15,305
Mercy is weakness.

236
00:19:16,145 --> 00:19:18,625
Only slaughter endures.

237
00:19:33,945 --> 00:19:36,705
The pond needs cleaning.

238
00:19:41,905 --> 00:19:43,185
What a plump chicken.

239
00:19:46,465 --> 00:19:47,585
Look at this one.

240
00:19:47,665 --> 00:19:48,825
Give it to me.

241
00:19:48,905 --> 00:19:50,505
-Let's go.
-Come and have a look!

242
00:19:50,585 --> 00:19:52,545
-Miss Chu.
-Miss Chu.

243
00:19:52,625 --> 00:19:55,345
-Miss Chu.
-It's rare to see you out so early.

244
00:19:55,425 --> 00:19:56,265
What are you looking for?

245
00:19:56,345 --> 00:19:57,305
You're welcome to choose from my shop.

246
00:19:59,745 --> 00:20:00,705
Take your time.

247
00:20:00,785 --> 00:20:02,025
Do come by when you're free.

248
00:20:03,905 --> 00:20:06,265
Sweet and crisp pears.

249
00:20:07,865 --> 00:20:10,385
Miss Chu. Miss Chu.

250
00:20:10,465 --> 00:20:13,065
Miss Chu. These pears were freshly picked.

251
00:20:13,665 --> 00:20:14,865
Please, try some.

252
00:20:14,945 --> 00:20:17,545
No, thank you. You should keep them.

253
00:20:17,625 --> 00:20:18,705
The harvest has been exceptional
this year.

254
00:20:18,785 --> 00:20:20,745
Just take them
as a share of our good fortune.

255
00:20:20,825 --> 00:20:22,545
When General Chu was still with us,

256
00:20:23,265 --> 00:20:24,465
he always loved our pears.

257
00:20:25,625 --> 00:20:26,825
-Please, take it.
-I'll take it.

258
00:20:28,105 --> 00:20:30,785
Alright. Miss Chu,
I'll get back to work then.

259
00:20:39,185 --> 00:20:40,585
-This gadget
-Come and see.

260
00:20:40,665 --> 00:20:42,945
-can also be used to catch rats.
-Fresh flatbread.

261
00:20:43,025 --> 00:20:44,105
Is that so?

262
00:20:44,905 --> 00:20:47,065
Take a look. Fresh flatbread.

263
00:20:47,905 --> 00:20:50,465
Hot flatbread.
Get your fresh flatbread here.

264
00:20:52,305 --> 00:20:55,345
These flatbreads are meant for sale,
so stop gorging yourself on them.

265
00:20:56,105 --> 00:20:59,025
Are you some kind of gluttonous beast?

266
00:20:59,545 --> 00:21:00,865
I'm giving you a beating right now.

267
00:21:00,945 --> 00:21:03,305
KEEN, DETERMINED, SCHOLARLY, AND STRATEGIC

268
00:21:07,825 --> 00:21:08,705
Stop right there.

269
00:21:11,145 --> 00:21:12,465
Have you been out brawling again?

270
00:21:14,265 --> 00:21:15,105
Did you lose?

271
00:21:15,625 --> 00:21:16,465
I won.

272
00:21:16,545 --> 00:21:18,225
It was three against one,

273
00:21:18,305 --> 00:21:20,265
and I left every single one of them
eating dirt.

274
00:21:20,345 --> 00:21:22,305
You're covered in bruises.

275
00:21:22,385 --> 00:21:23,225
What is there to be proud of?

276
00:21:23,905 --> 00:21:25,745
They were calling me a motherless child.

277
00:21:29,545 --> 00:21:31,985
And so, you used your fists
to shut them up?

278
00:21:32,065 --> 00:21:33,065
Why did I allow you
to practice martial arts

279
00:21:33,145 --> 00:21:34,465
in the first place?

280
00:21:35,305 --> 00:21:36,185
To beat people up.

281
00:21:37,945 --> 00:21:40,145
To protect the defenseless.

282
00:21:40,225 --> 00:21:45,745
Your fists should be aimed at villains,
not at children your own age,

283
00:21:46,345 --> 00:21:47,625
and certainly never at your own people.

284
00:21:52,425 --> 00:21:53,305
What's on your mind?

285
00:21:54,185 --> 00:21:55,505
I was just thinking

286
00:21:57,625 --> 00:21:58,625
about something my father said.

287
00:22:00,385 --> 00:22:01,425
See?

288
00:22:02,625 --> 00:22:07,225
My father didn't give his life
for these cold city walls,

289
00:22:08,385 --> 00:22:09,585
but for the laughter…

290
00:22:09,665 --> 00:22:10,505
Two <i>wen</i> will be enough.

291
00:22:10,585 --> 00:22:11,425
…and for the

292
00:22:12,225 --> 00:22:13,505
hustle and bustle of daily lives.

293
00:22:14,945 --> 00:22:18,745
Seemingly ordinary
and insignificant though they be,

294
00:22:18,825 --> 00:22:22,305
yet these things are held dear
above all price in every heart.

295
00:22:23,065 --> 00:22:25,465
I seek no grand vision
of a tranquil realm.

296
00:22:26,065 --> 00:22:28,585
I ask only that the hearth-smoke
of Yunzhong Prefecture rises each day

297
00:22:29,505 --> 00:22:31,745
and that mothers may stand at their gates

298
00:22:32,345 --> 00:22:34,345
awaiting their children
to come home for dinner.

299
00:22:35,185 --> 00:22:37,905
The worst thing
these people should have to worry about

300
00:22:37,985 --> 00:22:40,025
is if the price of rice has gone up
by a few <i>wen</i> tomorrow.

301
00:22:40,905 --> 00:22:41,745
That is enough.

302
00:22:42,865 --> 00:22:48,145
We drift through our days,
sunrise to sunset, unaware

303
00:22:49,025 --> 00:22:50,385
that this life we take for granted

304
00:22:50,985 --> 00:22:52,785
is the very thing others would kneel
and pray for, yet never get.

305
00:22:52,865 --> 00:22:56,785
Fresh pears! Come and have a look!

306
00:22:56,865 --> 00:22:58,385
Maybe in the farmer's eye, the pears

307
00:23:00,865 --> 00:23:02,745
taste sweeter than they did last year,

308
00:23:04,545 --> 00:23:05,385
right?

309
00:23:08,385 --> 00:23:09,345
Jiu.

310
00:23:10,905 --> 00:23:13,745
Please guard Yunzhong Prefecture
in my father's stead.

311
00:23:14,345 --> 00:23:15,905
Become the sharpest blade

312
00:23:16,585 --> 00:23:18,185
in the State of Chu,
just as Chu Ling once was.

313
00:23:19,865 --> 00:23:20,745
I will.

314
00:23:24,265 --> 00:23:26,145
Your Highness, there is stirring
from the Northern Desert.

315
00:23:26,225 --> 00:23:28,345
An enemy scouting team
is probing our frontier.

316
00:23:33,505 --> 00:23:34,665
What's the situation?

317
00:23:34,745 --> 00:23:36,985
The enemy's vanguard launched
a surprise raid on our fortress.

318
00:23:37,065 --> 00:23:38,865
Our left flank has deployed
to encircle and eliminate them.

319
00:23:39,705 --> 00:23:40,865
Your Highness, please rest assured.

320
00:23:40,945 --> 00:23:44,545
We can split our forces
and strike the Chi'na Unit's main army.

321
00:23:46,185 --> 00:23:47,105
Wait.

322
00:23:47,185 --> 00:23:48,465
The scout actually pinpointed

323
00:23:48,545 --> 00:23:50,385
the exact movements
of Chi'na Unit's main force.

324
00:23:53,025 --> 00:23:53,865
During the last battle,

325
00:23:54,505 --> 00:23:56,945
the Northern Desert King's main troops
retreated at least 80 li.

326
00:23:58,065 --> 00:24:01,785
Their elite forces
are still stationed near Yingzui Cliff.

327
00:24:01,865 --> 00:24:03,385
It is physically impossible

328
00:24:04,665 --> 00:24:06,345
for the Chi'na Unit
to appear here within a mere two days.

329
00:24:07,745 --> 00:24:10,425
This surprise raid is a tactical trap.

330
00:24:11,105 --> 00:24:12,665
Then our left flank
is walking into a disaster.

331
00:24:12,745 --> 00:24:13,705
More than just a disaster.

332
00:24:14,305 --> 00:24:18,705
If this truly is an ambush,
our left flank will be entirely wiped out.

333
00:24:20,585 --> 00:24:23,665
We must crush this offensive
before it can even develop.

334
00:24:24,385 --> 00:24:26,945
But our reserves can only hold one front.

335
00:24:27,025 --> 00:24:28,545
If we divert troops
to reinforce the flank,

336
00:24:28,625 --> 00:24:31,185
our main defensive line
will be left completely exposed.

337
00:24:31,865 --> 00:24:33,665
-Then we'll borrow forces.
-From whom?

338
00:24:34,345 --> 00:24:35,305
The Cangmu Stronghold.

339
00:24:36,545 --> 00:24:38,025
Defeating Tie Ying at Cangmu Forest

340
00:24:38,105 --> 00:24:40,985
came down to their familiarity
with woodland combat,

341
00:24:41,065 --> 00:24:42,145
an advantage our troops could not match.

342
00:24:42,865 --> 00:24:44,905
If we can harness their strength
to coordinate with our forces,

343
00:24:44,985 --> 00:24:46,305
the victory will be ours.

344
00:24:47,105 --> 00:24:50,025
But the Cangmu Stronghold is…

345
00:24:50,105 --> 00:24:51,345
My father has just passed away.

346
00:24:51,425 --> 00:24:53,465
Neither the army's morale
nor the people's trust must waver.

347
00:24:53,545 --> 00:24:54,385
Should we fall in this battle,

348
00:24:55,065 --> 00:24:56,465
the Northern Desert
will strike with all their might.

349
00:24:57,345 --> 00:24:59,065
Mr. Zhong, we have no retreat.

350
00:24:59,945 --> 00:25:01,665
Very well. We will proceed as you suggest.

351
00:25:17,545 --> 00:25:18,385
Rest assured.

352
00:25:20,225 --> 00:25:23,825
I will fight to my last breath
to secure victory.

353
00:25:26,705 --> 00:25:27,585
Xie Yanlai, take your orders.

354
00:25:30,865 --> 00:25:31,825
Yes, Your Highness.

355
00:25:32,505 --> 00:25:33,425
Go…

356
00:25:34,905 --> 00:25:35,745
and stay alive.

357
00:25:52,345 --> 00:25:53,465
This is no military order.

358
00:25:55,465 --> 00:25:56,465
This is my order.

359
00:26:02,705 --> 00:26:03,665
Yes, Your Highness.

360
00:26:48,465 --> 00:26:49,345
Move out!

361
00:27:32,385 --> 00:27:35,145
XIE RESIDENCE

362
00:27:35,225 --> 00:27:37,865
Deng Yi actually had the audacity
to investigate our old estate in Gaoyang.

363
00:27:38,385 --> 00:27:39,865
The news about Xie Yanlai
and the Bloodburn Pill

364
00:27:39,945 --> 00:27:41,225
must have been leaked by him as well.

365
00:27:41,985 --> 00:27:45,905
Deng Yi is actually targeting my clan.

366
00:27:47,265 --> 00:27:48,625
He is truly ruthless,

367
00:27:49,665 --> 00:27:52,825
bent on wiping out my entire clan.

368
00:27:53,345 --> 00:27:55,345
Deng Yi is a man of profound calculation.

369
00:27:55,945 --> 00:27:57,105
If not for your benevolence,

370
00:27:57,185 --> 00:27:58,425
how could he have been allowed
to live until this day?

371
00:27:59,705 --> 00:28:01,625
He was the Grand Mentor
appointed by the late Emperor

372
00:28:02,785 --> 00:28:04,505
and holds the position of Regent,

373
00:28:05,625 --> 00:28:07,465
so he cannot be easily disposed of.

374
00:28:08,185 --> 00:28:10,265
Moreover, he still has
Xiao Xun as a fallback plan.

375
00:28:11,345 --> 00:28:13,025
Since Xiao suffered
a setback in Wangcheng,

376
00:28:13,105 --> 00:28:14,785
he will certainly not let the matter rest.

377
00:28:17,545 --> 00:28:18,505
A fallback plan?

378
00:28:19,105 --> 00:28:20,385
He calculated everything
in the battle of Wangcheng,

379
00:28:20,465 --> 00:28:21,665
yet his entire plan fell through.

380
00:28:22,985 --> 00:28:24,385
He can barely save himself now.

381
00:28:24,465 --> 00:28:28,785
Although the Northern Desert was defeated,
this war was like a massive earthquake.

382
00:28:29,625 --> 00:28:32,585
The real aftershocks
are just about to begin.

383
00:28:33,865 --> 00:28:36,265
Xiao Xun will definitely bide his time
to make a move.

384
00:28:38,305 --> 00:28:40,625
Keep a close eye on Xiaonan Prefecture.

385
00:28:42,145 --> 00:28:43,105
Yes.

386
00:28:58,585 --> 00:29:00,385
CHU

387
00:29:12,945 --> 00:29:14,185
Zhao,

388
00:29:14,265 --> 00:29:16,825
however anxious you are,
you must eat something.

389
00:29:18,185 --> 00:29:20,825
Mr. Zhong, I have no appetite.

390
00:29:24,985 --> 00:29:26,345
Victory!

391
00:29:26,945 --> 00:29:28,025
Victory!

392
00:29:28,545 --> 00:29:30,065
Your Highness,
Assistant General Xie has won!

393
00:29:30,145 --> 00:29:31,305
He routed the enemy's vanguard

394
00:29:31,385 --> 00:29:32,585
and even captured the Northern Desert
King's son-in-law alive!

395
00:29:34,825 --> 00:29:39,145
-Victory!
-Victory!

396
00:29:39,225 --> 00:29:41,225
Our troops' morale is now secure.

397
00:29:41,745 --> 00:29:43,305
General Zhong, you can rest assured now.

398
00:29:44,025 --> 00:29:46,385
With Her Highness here,
a great victory is all but certain.

399
00:29:46,465 --> 00:29:49,265
Quick! Report our triumph
to the Capital at once!

400
00:29:49,785 --> 00:29:51,305
Let everyone know

401
00:29:51,385 --> 00:29:54,785
that even though
Guard General Chu Ling is gone,

402
00:29:54,865 --> 00:29:56,305
the frontier still achieves
great victories,

403
00:29:56,385 --> 00:29:58,305
and the state remains secure.

404
00:29:58,385 --> 00:29:59,425
Yes!

405
00:30:02,705 --> 00:30:06,385
-Victory!
-Victory!

406
00:30:16,225 --> 00:30:17,065
There is a city ahead.

407
00:30:17,665 --> 00:30:18,785
Go in and announce the victory.

408
00:30:19,665 --> 00:30:22,145
Have the yamen
spread the news across the region!

409
00:30:27,825 --> 00:30:29,185
The Northern Desert has returned,

410
00:30:29,265 --> 00:30:30,385
their cavalry has broken
through Bailang Pass,

411
00:30:30,985 --> 00:30:32,745
and Yunzhong Prefecture
shall fall within three days.

412
00:30:32,825 --> 00:30:34,225
The Northern Desert army marches
straight for the Capital!

413
00:30:34,305 --> 00:30:35,945
The Northern Desert army marches
straight for the Capital!

414
00:30:36,025 --> 00:30:38,065
The Northern Desert army marches
straight for the Capital!

415
00:30:42,145 --> 00:30:44,745
Your Highness, there is one thing
I do not understand.

416
00:30:46,025 --> 00:30:46,905
Speak.

417
00:30:48,225 --> 00:30:50,705
We are already at odds
with the Northern Desert,

418
00:30:51,225 --> 00:30:54,025
so why do you still believe
they will help us?

419
00:30:54,625 --> 00:30:55,945
You are wrong, Tie Ying.

420
00:30:57,345 --> 00:31:02,265
Since the battle of Wangcheng,
I have expected nothing more from them.

421
00:31:03,505 --> 00:31:05,425
To share dominion?

422
00:31:06,585 --> 00:31:08,705
It is nothing but their idle dream.

423
00:31:09,305 --> 00:31:12,305
The war with the Northern Desert
has shaken the land,

424
00:31:12,825 --> 00:31:14,305
and the aftershocks are bound to follow.

425
00:31:14,385 --> 00:31:16,345
With Chu Ling gone,

426
00:31:17,265 --> 00:31:19,625
the Northern Desert King
will seize the moment to invade.

427
00:31:20,585 --> 00:31:24,065
I will use them
to shackle Yunzhong Prefecture.

428
00:31:24,665 --> 00:31:27,265
So what if Chu Zhao wins the battle?

429
00:31:28,145 --> 00:31:31,145
As long as the news
never reaches the Capital,

430
00:31:31,905 --> 00:31:33,585
this victory never happened.

431
00:31:34,185 --> 00:31:35,385
We've killed the dispatch riders

432
00:31:35,905 --> 00:31:37,425
and turned news of victory
into news of defeat.

433
00:31:39,505 --> 00:31:42,105
Once the Capital descends into panic,

434
00:31:43,265 --> 00:31:46,745
be it victory or defeat,

435
00:31:46,825 --> 00:31:50,225
I'll have my pretext
to march under the banner

436
00:31:50,305 --> 00:31:51,665
of protecting the Capital.

437
00:31:51,745 --> 00:31:53,305
And when that moment comes,

438
00:31:54,305 --> 00:31:58,825
it will be time for someone else
to sit on the throne.

439
00:32:00,425 --> 00:32:01,265
Your Highness is wise.

440
00:32:20,505 --> 00:32:23,985
What task is this that has distressed
Your Majesty so?

441
00:32:24,505 --> 00:32:26,225
How could any task trouble me?

442
00:32:26,745 --> 00:32:28,505
I am writing a letter to Zhao.

443
00:32:29,545 --> 00:32:33,105
The loss of parents is something
no words can console.

444
00:32:33,625 --> 00:32:34,465
I know.

445
00:32:39,025 --> 00:32:40,625
Your Majesty, Mr. Xie
requests an audience.

446
00:32:41,225 --> 00:32:42,065
It is so late.

447
00:32:42,145 --> 00:32:43,465
Tell Mr. Xie that I have retired
for the night.

448
00:32:43,545 --> 00:32:44,505
But Mr. Xie…

449
00:32:44,585 --> 00:32:46,505
I have an urgent matter
to discuss with His Majesty.

450
00:32:47,225 --> 00:32:48,105
You may withdraw.

451
00:32:49,185 --> 00:32:50,025
You're dismissed.

452
00:33:03,145 --> 00:33:05,465
Uncle, what is it
that you wish to tell me?

453
00:33:06,065 --> 00:33:08,465
The dispatch riders reported
that the Northern Desert had returned.

454
00:33:08,545 --> 00:33:10,105
They raided at midnight,
and our frontier troops fell.

455
00:33:10,905 --> 00:33:13,145
They have routed Yunzhong Prefecture
and are heading straight for the Capital.

456
00:33:13,745 --> 00:33:14,625
Upon hearing the news,
the Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture

457
00:33:14,705 --> 00:33:16,065
assembled 50,000 troops

458
00:33:16,145 --> 00:33:17,665
and is now 800 li away from the Capital.

459
00:33:23,785 --> 00:33:24,705
Yu,

460
00:33:26,185 --> 00:33:27,105
do not be afraid.

461
00:33:27,985 --> 00:33:31,065
The news may not necessarily be true.

462
00:33:31,665 --> 00:33:33,145
It might just be a ploy to create panic,

463
00:33:33,665 --> 00:33:36,105
making it convenient for the Prince
to lead his troops into the Capital

464
00:33:36,185 --> 00:33:37,585
under the pretext of defending the city.

465
00:33:38,185 --> 00:33:40,385
Are they planning to rebel?

466
00:33:41,025 --> 00:33:43,305
From the very moment
the Prince left the Capital,

467
00:33:43,825 --> 00:33:45,185
he has always harbored treasonous intent.

468
00:33:45,785 --> 00:33:48,585
This matter is of grave importance,
which is why I came in the dead of night.

469
00:33:49,345 --> 00:33:54,145
We must first agree on how to respond
during tomorrow's court session.

470
00:33:56,505 --> 00:33:57,585
<i>An urgent dispatch has arrived.</i>

471
00:33:57,665 --> 00:33:59,745
The Northern Desert has returned.

472
00:33:59,825 --> 00:34:01,705
Their cavalry has broken
through Bailang Pass,

473
00:34:01,785 --> 00:34:03,985
and Yunzhong will fall within three days.

474
00:34:04,065 --> 00:34:05,625
The enemy is pressing toward the Capital.

475
00:34:08,824 --> 00:34:11,865
With Chu Ling dead,
the frontier is indeed…

476
00:34:11,945 --> 00:34:14,065
The Grand Princess is a woman after all,

477
00:34:14,865 --> 00:34:17,585
so how could we truly expect her
to defend the frontier?

478
00:34:18,185 --> 00:34:20,105
Xiao Xun, heir to the Lord of Xiaonan,

479
00:34:20,185 --> 00:34:23,025
has led 50,000 troops
to defend the Capital

480
00:34:23,784 --> 00:34:25,465
and is only a few days' journey away.

481
00:34:27,145 --> 00:34:29,905
I petition Your Majesty
to open the city gates

482
00:34:29,985 --> 00:34:34,385
and let them in to defend the Capital
to ensure its peace.

483
00:34:34,465 --> 00:34:35,304
‎DILIGENT AND VIRTUOUS

484
00:34:35,385 --> 00:34:38,505
The Prince of Xiaonan
commands 50,000 troops,

485
00:34:39,145 --> 00:34:41,905
the Capital another 50,000,

486
00:34:41,985 --> 00:34:45,185
and with forces
from other prefectures combined,

487
00:34:45,264 --> 00:34:49,344
we have more than enough to hold
against the Northern Desert troops.

488
00:34:50,065 --> 00:34:53,784
There is indeed less reason to panic.

489
00:34:56,225 --> 00:34:57,065
Ignorant.

490
00:34:57,985 --> 00:35:00,185
A prince granted a fiefdom

491
00:35:00,785 --> 00:35:02,265
may collect its taxes
and live off its revenues,

492
00:35:02,785 --> 00:35:04,145
but holds no authority over troops.

493
00:35:04,825 --> 00:35:08,745
Even their guard
is capped at a fixed number.

494
00:35:09,425 --> 00:35:11,145
Where did he find 50,000 troops?

495
00:35:11,745 --> 00:35:14,425
In my view,
the Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture

496
00:35:14,505 --> 00:35:17,065
uses the defense of the Capital
as a pretext

497
00:35:17,145 --> 00:35:18,905
to mask his rebellion.

498
00:35:19,505 --> 00:35:21,145
Mr. Xie, do you imply

499
00:35:21,665 --> 00:35:23,745
that His Majesty should just sit and wait
for the enemy to besiege the Capital?

500
00:35:23,825 --> 00:35:25,225
Fifty thousand troops

501
00:35:26,025 --> 00:35:27,745
are the entire strength
of the Capital's garrison.

502
00:35:28,345 --> 00:35:30,705
Allowing these troops to enter the city?

503
00:35:30,785 --> 00:35:33,865
Do you understand the consequences
if things spin out of control?

504
00:35:35,145 --> 00:35:35,985
The Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture

505
00:35:36,065 --> 00:35:37,505
neither offered his condolences
nor paid his respects at court.

506
00:35:38,105 --> 00:35:39,425
His intentions could not be clearer.

507
00:35:40,025 --> 00:35:41,465
Now that Chu Ling is dead,

508
00:35:42,305 --> 00:35:44,025
the threat from the Northern Desert
is greater than ever.

509
00:35:45,065 --> 00:35:49,465
I fear the Prince
wants to take advantage of the chaos.

510
00:35:50,145 --> 00:35:52,385
Just as Mr. Xie said,

511
00:35:52,465 --> 00:35:53,945
the threat from the Northern Desert
is so massive

512
00:35:54,025 --> 00:35:55,705
that we cannot afford to gamble at all.

513
00:35:56,305 --> 00:35:57,865
If we are paranoid at this moment,

514
00:35:57,945 --> 00:35:59,265
and the Northern Desert truly breaks
through Yunzhong,

515
00:35:59,345 --> 00:36:02,425
the Capital will fall,
the state will no longer be a state,

516
00:36:03,065 --> 00:36:04,865
and we will be condemned for eternity.

517
00:36:04,945 --> 00:36:06,945
Your entire premise

518
00:36:07,465 --> 00:36:08,945
rests on the authenticity
of that military report.

519
00:36:10,185 --> 00:36:11,385
However, as I see it,

520
00:36:12,025 --> 00:36:14,905
the credibility of this military report
is still open to question.

521
00:36:16,025 --> 00:36:17,745
You took

522
00:36:18,505 --> 00:36:20,825
the frontier troops' victory reports
at face value

523
00:36:20,905 --> 00:36:22,945
and rewarded Yunzhong Prefecture.

524
00:36:23,025 --> 00:36:26,105
So dispatch riders bearing good news
are trustworthy,

525
00:36:26,625 --> 00:36:28,705
but those bringing ill tidings
are suddenly spies?

526
00:36:29,705 --> 00:36:30,785
What should we do then?

527
00:36:32,385 --> 00:36:33,265
Mr. Deng.

528
00:36:34,345 --> 00:36:35,225
I shall issue a decree

529
00:36:35,905 --> 00:36:37,225
ordering the Prince
of Xiaonan Prefecture's troops

530
00:36:37,305 --> 00:36:38,505
to be divided and stationed

531
00:36:38,585 --> 00:36:40,625
alongside the Capital's garrison
to defend the city.

532
00:36:41,465 --> 00:36:44,625
Your Majesty, this is indeed
an effective stalling tactic.

533
00:36:45,345 --> 00:36:48,105
Since the Prince and his heir use
the pretext of defending the Capital,

534
00:36:48,185 --> 00:36:50,585
Your Majesty can let them do so,

535
00:36:50,665 --> 00:36:52,785
but they must follow the deployments
of the imperial court.

536
00:36:53,425 --> 00:36:56,305
If they refuse to comply,
they will be treated as treacherous rebels

537
00:36:56,825 --> 00:36:58,105
whom anyone has the right to execute.

538
00:36:58,705 --> 00:37:02,305
When the state is in turmoil,
trouble will come from all sides.

539
00:37:02,905 --> 00:37:04,225
The Northern Desert King

540
00:37:04,745 --> 00:37:06,785
and the Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture
are no different.

541
00:37:07,865 --> 00:37:10,945
I have faced deat and weathered upheaval.

542
00:37:11,025 --> 00:37:15,625
I believe the State of Chu will endure.

543
00:37:16,225 --> 00:37:19,545
-We shall give our last breath
-We shall give our last breath

544
00:37:19,625 --> 00:37:22,785
-in service to Your Majesty
-in service to Your Majesty

545
00:37:22,865 --> 00:37:25,385
-and the State of Chu.
-and the State of Chu.

546
00:37:35,465 --> 00:37:36,705
You may withdraw.

547
00:37:41,025 --> 00:37:43,825
Mr. Xie, Mr. Deng,
what is it that you wish to tell me?

548
00:37:43,905 --> 00:37:46,265
-Your Majesty.
-The Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture leads

549
00:37:46,345 --> 00:37:47,185
not 50,000 troops,

550
00:37:47,265 --> 00:37:48,545
but 100,000.

551
00:37:49,065 --> 00:37:52,105
They are now less
than 800 li from the Capital.

552
00:37:53,505 --> 00:37:54,665
A military march to defend the Capital?

553
00:37:55,625 --> 00:37:56,945
No. This is treason.

554
00:37:57,025 --> 00:37:58,305
Mr. Xie, watch your words.

555
00:37:58,905 --> 00:38:00,905
We do not know
if the news is true or false,

556
00:38:01,425 --> 00:38:02,585
so we must not make rash judgments.

557
00:38:03,185 --> 00:38:04,785
Have you notified Zhao?

558
00:38:05,745 --> 00:38:08,145
I fear the news might be blocked
from reaching Her Highness.

559
00:38:08,225 --> 00:38:09,625
You keep claiming

560
00:38:09,705 --> 00:38:11,625
that the Prince of Xiaonan
and Xiao Xun are rebelling,

561
00:38:11,705 --> 00:38:13,345
yet you cannot produce
any concrete evidence.

562
00:38:14,265 --> 00:38:15,865
With the enemy closing in,

563
00:38:16,665 --> 00:38:18,065
the defense of the Capital
is our top priority.

564
00:38:18,145 --> 00:38:22,385
So you still wish to open the gates

565
00:38:23,025 --> 00:38:25,145
and let the Xiaonan Army in?

566
00:38:26,385 --> 00:38:28,745
I am doing this
for the safety of the Capital.

567
00:38:29,505 --> 00:38:31,305
If the Northern Desert launches an attack,

568
00:38:31,385 --> 00:38:32,985
how are the citizens
of the Capital supposed

569
00:38:33,065 --> 00:38:33,985
to protect themselves?

570
00:38:37,385 --> 00:38:38,665
Speculation is useless.

571
00:38:39,545 --> 00:38:43,985
We might as well wait and see
what Xiao Xun decides.

572
00:38:51,025 --> 00:38:52,345
I shall take my leave.

573
00:39:01,265 --> 00:39:02,985
This is the token
of the Imperial Guard Commander.

574
00:39:03,065 --> 00:39:04,705
After Uncle Yanlai left the Capital,

575
00:39:04,785 --> 00:39:06,465
the command of the Imperial Guard
was handed to his deputy.

576
00:39:07,385 --> 00:39:10,025
The token has been kept with me.

577
00:39:10,945 --> 00:39:14,505
Since the situation is critical,
I will leave it in your safekeeping.

578
00:39:18,105 --> 00:39:18,985
Very well.

579
00:39:20,105 --> 00:39:23,905
I will ensure your safety.

580
00:39:26,665 --> 00:39:28,385
His Majesty handed the token
of the Imperial Guard Commander over

581
00:39:28,465 --> 00:39:30,105
to Xie Yanfang.

582
00:39:30,185 --> 00:39:32,105
So the Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture
actually did him a favor?

583
00:39:32,985 --> 00:39:33,985
It was bound to happen sooner or later.

584
00:39:34,625 --> 00:39:38,265
Even without the Prince,
Mr. Xie would achieve his wish very soon.

585
00:39:39,105 --> 00:39:40,545
His Majesty is helpless.

586
00:39:41,065 --> 00:39:43,145
Why would he ever grow distant
from his uncle?

587
00:39:44,105 --> 00:39:46,505
A child's face and heart
are the most fickle things

588
00:39:47,025 --> 00:39:49,025
in the world.

589
00:39:49,905 --> 00:39:50,865
I warned him.

590
00:39:53,865 --> 00:39:55,145
No matter.

591
00:39:55,785 --> 00:40:00,185
Whoever His Majesty chooses to favor
is no concern of mine.

592
00:40:00,945 --> 00:40:03,625
Dispatch the edict to the Prince
of Xiaonan Prefecture at once.

593
00:40:05,745 --> 00:40:07,585
Select a suitable envoy to deliver it,

594
00:40:08,305 --> 00:40:10,065
and make sure it is done
with great fanfare.

595
00:40:11,105 --> 00:40:12,025
Understood.

596
00:40:12,105 --> 00:40:14,265
MEMORIAL ON EDUCATION AND AGRICULTURE

597
00:40:16,585 --> 00:40:18,625
Mr. Xie, a scout reports

598
00:40:18,705 --> 00:40:19,985
that the vanguard of Prince of Xiaonan
has arrived at Baili Pavilion.

599
00:40:26,625 --> 00:40:28,865
Xiao Xun used fake dispatch riders
to spread the news,

600
00:40:30,465 --> 00:40:33,105
executing a real palace coup under
the pretext of defending the Capital.

601
00:40:33,945 --> 00:40:35,945
The public has been taken in by him

602
00:40:36,025 --> 00:40:38,825
and truly believes he came
to protect His Majesty.

603
00:40:39,585 --> 00:40:41,545
They can't wait to throw wide
the city gates

604
00:40:42,305 --> 00:40:43,665
and welcome him with open arms.

605
00:40:43,745 --> 00:40:44,585
Deng Yi

606
00:40:45,225 --> 00:40:48,105
has clearly been won over by Xiao Xun
and is willing to do his bidding.

607
00:40:49,345 --> 00:40:50,505
Public opinion is like the wind.

608
00:40:51,585 --> 00:40:52,625
Fight it and you suffer.

609
00:40:52,705 --> 00:40:53,825
Ride it and you prevail.

610
00:40:55,145 --> 00:40:59,145
He can take the Capital
without spilling a drop of blood.

611
00:40:59,745 --> 00:41:01,025
What should we do?

612
00:41:01,105 --> 00:41:04,385
I have informed Yu
about the movements of the Xiaonan Army

613
00:41:05,025 --> 00:41:08,225
and coached him on what to say
and how to draft the imperial edict.

614
00:41:09,025 --> 00:41:11,385
It was all to fan the flames

615
00:41:12,105 --> 00:41:16,185
and let the coming battle play out
before the world.

616
00:41:17,225 --> 00:41:18,825
The Xie Family

617
00:41:20,345 --> 00:41:24,425
will be the greatest beneficiary
of this confrontation.

618
00:41:30,425 --> 00:41:31,905
Deng Yi had the way cleared with drums.

619
00:41:32,505 --> 00:41:33,785
The imperial envoy is heading
toward the Xiaonan Army Camp,

620
00:41:33,865 --> 00:41:34,705
the imperial banner held high.

621
00:41:37,905 --> 00:41:40,305
XIAONAN ARMY CAMP

622
00:41:41,105 --> 00:41:42,665
Any who neglect their duty

623
00:41:42,745 --> 00:41:45,065
shall face the full severity
of the military law.

624
00:41:45,145 --> 00:41:47,905
But those who stand resolute,
who defend this city with valor,

625
00:41:47,985 --> 00:41:49,585
shall be richly rewarded.

626
00:41:49,665 --> 00:41:54,545
So long as this city stands secure,
the state shall endure.

627
00:41:56,625 --> 00:41:58,225
Your Highness, please receive
the imperial edict.

628
00:42:02,945 --> 00:42:06,505
Your Highness, this is written
by His Majesty's own hand.

629
00:42:08,385 --> 00:42:09,385
I know.

630
00:42:09,465 --> 00:42:11,265
You… How insolent!

631
00:42:13,105 --> 00:42:13,985
Xiao Xun,

632
00:42:14,065 --> 00:42:17,065
are you and your father truly going
to defy the imperial command

633
00:42:17,145 --> 00:42:18,905
and commit treason?

634
00:42:26,065 --> 00:42:27,065
Imperial command?

635
00:42:29,625 --> 00:42:30,825
Treason?

636
00:42:33,585 --> 00:42:35,225
The edict states

637
00:42:35,745 --> 00:42:39,105
that 50,000 troops
stand arrayed outside the city.

638
00:42:39,785 --> 00:42:43,065
Aren't they just waiting for me
to defy the command?

639
00:42:44,105 --> 00:42:48,905
It is the perfect pretext
to have me branded a rebel

640
00:42:48,985 --> 00:42:49,825
and start a war.

641
00:42:52,905 --> 00:42:58,665
When blades are drawn
and the cavalry cuts through,

642
00:42:59,825 --> 00:43:01,825
the dead will be beyond count

643
00:43:01,905 --> 00:43:03,545
and the land strewn with the starving.

644
00:43:04,705 --> 00:43:07,185
All of it will become
the fault of Xiaonan Prefecture.

645
00:43:08,545 --> 00:43:12,985
And with the false charge of treason
you have already pinned on me,

646
00:43:13,785 --> 00:43:15,145
the crimes only pile higher.

647
00:43:16,545 --> 00:43:20,545
And I would be guilty
beyond all redemption.

648
00:43:27,145 --> 00:43:28,465
I accept the edict

649
00:43:29,105 --> 00:43:33,385
and will heed His Majesty's command
to protect the Capital.

650
00:43:33,985 --> 00:43:35,105
But sir,

651
00:43:35,705 --> 00:43:37,385
casting an imperial edict into the fire

652
00:43:38,185 --> 00:43:39,705
is an unpardonable offense
against His Majesty.

653
00:43:43,385 --> 00:43:44,345
How dare you!

654
00:43:44,945 --> 00:43:47,585
Go. Make sure he is "taken care of".

655
00:43:49,225 --> 00:43:50,265
Xiao Xun,

656
00:43:50,945 --> 00:43:52,425
you're persecuting a loyal minister!

657
00:43:52,505 --> 00:43:53,745
You will meet a miserable end!

658
00:43:53,825 --> 00:43:57,105
Xiao Xun, how dare you
burn the imperial decree?

659
00:44:00,105 --> 00:44:01,345
Hear my command.

660
00:44:02,265 --> 00:44:03,465
Break camp tomorrow.

661
00:44:03,545 --> 00:44:07,145
Split our forces into four routes
and advance on the Capital!

662
00:44:08,025 --> 00:44:09,185
-Understood!
-Understood!

663
00:44:09,265 --> 00:44:10,705
THE CAPITAL

